WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.500
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.770 --> 01:38.920
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.250 --> 01:41.820
[Episode 24]

4
01:42.080 --> 01:44.120
[Yu Mansion]

5
01:54.680 --> 01:55.200
Isn't this

6
01:55.200 --> 01:56.100
Changxuan's favorite

7
01:56.100 --> 01:57.560
three-shred spring roll?

8
01:57.780 --> 01:58.780
Yes, Sixth Miss.

9
01:59.090 --> 02:00.980
The three main fillings in the spring rolls this time

10
02:00.980 --> 02:02.950
are flavored with scallop broth.

11
02:03.260 --> 02:04.650
We specially used Tianmu Mountain's

12
02:04.650 --> 02:06.180
best tender bamboo shoots,

13
02:06.180 --> 02:08.060
paired with shredded ham from Xuanwei

14
02:08.060 --> 02:10.410
and shredded tender breast from chickens freshly slaughtered on the same day.

15
02:10.410 --> 02:11.190
They are all made according to

16
02:11.190 --> 02:13.180
Fifth Young Master Yu's usual preferences.

17
02:13.180 --> 02:14.450
You can really taste the freshness

18
02:14.450 --> 02:15.410
of spring.

19
02:15.650 --> 02:18.050
This dish is also called "A Bite of Spring."

20
02:18.180 --> 02:19.620
It's not just for the good luck

21
02:19.620 --> 02:20.210
of welcoming the new year.

22
02:20.210 --> 02:21.530
The layers of the spring roll

23
02:21.530 --> 02:23.620
also keep the blessings wrapped inside,

24
02:23.620 --> 02:24.930
bringing the whole family good fortune

25
02:24.930 --> 02:27.190
and smooth sailing throughout the year.

26
02:28.740 --> 02:30.690
Changxuan still hasn't come back.

27
02:32.020 --> 02:33.550
He's going to miss it again.

28
02:33.870 --> 02:34.680
Yeah.

29
02:36.079 --> 02:37.620
I wonder when Miss Ye

30
02:38.060 --> 02:39.590
will wake up.

31
02:40.240 --> 02:41.640
It's been over two years.

32
02:41.800 --> 02:44.120
What if she never wakes up?

33
02:44.620 --> 02:45.520
Third Mother,

34
02:45.680 --> 02:47.410
you shouldn't say such a thing.

35
02:47.960 --> 02:49.410
If something terrible

36
02:49.410 --> 02:50.020
really happens

37
02:50.020 --> 02:51.190
to Miss Pingjun,

38
02:51.620 --> 02:53.780
how will Changxuan live?

39
02:55.079 --> 02:55.810
No.

40
02:58.210 --> 03:00.150
I still feel uneasy.

41
03:01.020 --> 03:02.750
I have to make a trip to Fengtai.

42
03:02.860 --> 03:03.650
Mom,

43
03:04.120 --> 03:05.340
since Changxuan told us

44
03:05.340 --> 03:06.580
not to disturb them,

45
03:06.580 --> 03:09.180
he must have his own plans and considerations.

46
03:09.650 --> 03:11.970
Let's just peacefully wait at home

47
03:12.060 --> 03:13.720
and not cause him any trouble.

48
03:15.360 --> 03:16.420
That's right, Mom.

49
03:16.650 --> 03:18.910
Changxuan always knows what he's doing.

50
03:18.910 --> 03:20.210
Please rest assured.

51
03:24.310 --> 03:25.040
Let's eat.

52
03:40.240 --> 03:41.030
Young Madam,

53
03:42.370 --> 03:43.970
it's time for your medicine.

54
03:49.690 --> 03:50.870
I can do it myself.

55
03:51.070 --> 03:52.150
Careful.

56
04:09.400 --> 04:10.300
This medicine

57
04:11.080 --> 04:13.280
doesn't seem as bitter as it was yesterday.

58
04:13.280 --> 04:14.120
Fifth Young Master Yu saw that you

59
04:14.120 --> 04:15.210
found the medicine bitter yesterday,

60
04:15.210 --> 04:18.390
so he specially ordered us to mix it with osmanthus honey.

61
04:18.390 --> 04:19.680
He was afraid we'd forget,

62
04:19.680 --> 04:20.750
so he even wrote a note

63
04:20.750 --> 04:21.680
for the kitchen.

64
04:24.570 --> 04:25.390
Young Madam.

65
04:26.000 --> 04:28.050
I really don't quite understand.

66
04:28.800 --> 04:30.680
We all think that Fifth Young Master Yu treats you

67
04:30.680 --> 04:32.740
better than anyone else in the world.

68
04:33.570 --> 04:34.510
Why do you always

69
04:34.510 --> 04:36.180
look so unhappy?

70
04:40.190 --> 04:41.190
Just the fact

71
04:41.830 --> 04:43.240
that he could stay by my side

72
04:43.240 --> 04:44.630
while I was in a coma,

73
04:45.390 --> 04:47.500
taking good care of me for so long

74
04:47.770 --> 04:48.800
without leaving,

75
04:49.430 --> 04:50.680
is already something ordinary people

76
04:50.680 --> 04:51.870
can't do.

77
04:55.159 --> 04:57.060
When I woke up that day,

78
04:57.770 --> 04:58.870
I saw him.

79
04:59.890 --> 05:02.690
There was a glint of pleasant surprise in his eyes.

80
05:06.930 --> 05:07.730
You're awake.

81
05:10.540 --> 05:12.200
At that moment, I knew

82
05:13.260 --> 05:14.810
he was truly good to me.

83
05:17.130 --> 05:18.000
But,

84
05:18.930 --> 05:20.010
you always seem to

85
05:20.010 --> 05:22.410
keep a distance from Fifth Young Master Yu.

86
05:25.270 --> 05:26.770
I know he's great,

87
05:27.830 --> 05:29.570
but I don't know why

88
05:30.190 --> 05:31.480
I always feel

89
05:32.000 --> 05:32.740
like we are

90
05:32.740 --> 05:34.159
on different tracks.

91
05:35.870 --> 05:38.130
We're two people from different worlds.

92
05:38.480 --> 05:40.360
How could we ever end up together?

93
05:50.830 --> 05:51.690
Mr. Yu.

94
05:52.270 --> 05:53.930
What I want to say is,

95
05:54.000 --> 05:55.870
since we are from different worlds,

96
05:55.870 --> 05:58.400
it's better not to associate with each other.

97
06:02.170 --> 06:05.730
[Fengtai]

98
06:15.800 --> 06:17.310
I know he's great,

99
06:19.070 --> 06:20.800
but I don't know why

100
06:21.570 --> 06:22.600
I always feel

101
06:23.240 --> 06:24.060
like we are

102
06:24.060 --> 06:25.450
on different tracks.

103
06:27.100 --> 06:29.360
We're two people from different worlds.

104
06:29.610 --> 06:31.500
How could we ever end up together?

105
06:37.240 --> 06:39.240
Look at those gamblers downstairs.

106
06:40.830 --> 06:42.750
They always want to settle everything in one bet

107
06:42.750 --> 06:44.210
and change their destiny.

108
06:45.190 --> 06:46.270
But how could life

109
06:46.830 --> 06:47.930
be as simple

110
06:47.930 --> 06:48.950
as a gamble?

111
06:51.190 --> 06:53.050
Especially when it comes to love,

112
06:53.490 --> 06:54.860
once you lose the bet,

113
06:55.800 --> 06:57.100
there is no chance

114
06:57.280 --> 06:59.140
to turn the tables and start over.

115
07:09.970 --> 07:15.940
[Fengtai]

116
08:24.920 --> 08:26.050
Did you get scalded?

117
08:27.180 --> 08:27.820
No.

118
08:28.140 --> 08:29.340
It's just warm water.

119
08:43.450 --> 08:44.730
I can drink it myself.

120
09:09.440 --> 09:11.030
When did you get back?

121
09:12.460 --> 09:13.370
A while ago.

122
09:15.820 --> 09:17.550
Then did you have dinner?

123
09:17.940 --> 09:18.500
Should I

124
09:18.500 --> 09:21.240
have the kitchen make something and bring it over?

125
09:21.240 --> 09:21.750
No need.

126
09:38.310 --> 09:39.170
Your clothes are wet.

127
09:39.170 --> 09:41.170
Let me help you change into a new set.

128
09:41.550 --> 09:42.200
No need.

129
09:42.330 --> 09:43.270
I can do it myself.

130
09:43.270 --> 09:45.140
Your fingers have only just recovered and aren't flexible yet.

131
09:45.140 --> 09:46.000
Don't force it.

132
09:46.560 --> 09:47.740
Then I can get Xiaotang

133
09:47.740 --> 09:48.740
to help me change.

134
09:56.620 --> 09:58.420
Doesn't Xiaotang need to sleep?

135
09:59.410 --> 10:00.810
You used to always insist

136
10:00.900 --> 10:02.630
that all men are created equal.

137
10:02.630 --> 10:03.370
What?

138
10:03.890 --> 10:04.750
Should a maid

139
10:05.460 --> 10:06.890
be ordered around at will

140
10:08.320 --> 10:09.440
and stay up all night

141
10:09.440 --> 10:10.480
to serve you?

142
11:22.760 --> 11:24.290
What... What are you doing?

143
11:52.890 --> 11:54.590
If you need tea or water at night,

144
11:54.590 --> 11:55.720
ring the bell for me.

145
14:23.220 --> 14:24.820
It's windy and cold outside.

146
14:25.160 --> 14:27.690
Are you planning to freeze all night, my dear?

147
14:52.550 --> 14:54.310
You spend your day at the headquarters

148
14:54.310 --> 14:56.260
and handle military affairs.

149
14:56.750 --> 14:58.130
Having you do this at night

150
14:58.130 --> 14:59.660
is too much trouble for you.

151
15:01.080 --> 15:03.540
My dear, are you treating me as a decoration?

152
15:24.170 --> 15:25.410
If you want to summon me,

153
15:25.410 --> 15:26.200
do this.

154
15:29.980 --> 15:30.720
One ring

155
15:31.620 --> 15:32.670
for water.

156
15:42.290 --> 15:43.030
Two rings

157
15:44.080 --> 15:45.540
for an extra blanket.

158
15:57.980 --> 15:59.310
What about three rings?

159
16:02.370 --> 16:03.340
Three rings

160
16:05.320 --> 16:06.450
for when you miss me.

161
16:11.340 --> 16:12.170
Got it?

162
16:20.080 --> 16:20.890
It's okay.

163
16:21.980 --> 16:23.330
If you didn't get that,

164
16:24.340 --> 16:26.270
I can teach you from the beginning.

165
16:44.980 --> 16:46.040
What are you doing?

166
16:51.530 --> 16:53.260
Are you planning to sleep here?

167
16:53.310 --> 16:55.240
Since you couldn't bear to wake me,

168
16:55.550 --> 16:56.270
I have no choice but to stay

169
16:56.270 --> 16:57.480
by your side all night

170
16:57.560 --> 16:58.590
to serve you.

171
16:59.250 --> 17:00.380
You promised.

172
17:00.400 --> 17:01.500
We are not yet at the stage

173
17:01.500 --> 17:02.030
where we can sleep

174
17:02.030 --> 17:03.500
in the same bed.

175
17:06.680 --> 17:07.810
Get out.

176
17:17.970 --> 17:19.000
You said that

177
17:19.030 --> 17:20.280
as long as I ring the bell,

178
17:20.280 --> 17:21.740
you will follow my orders.

179
17:22.970 --> 17:24.740
You learn fast.

180
17:27.099 --> 17:28.369
Go sleep on your cot.

181
17:32.340 --> 17:32.910
Go.

182
18:01.750 --> 18:02.810
Three rings

183
18:04.680 --> 18:05.810
for when you miss me.

184
18:41.610 --> 18:42.270
Boss.

185
18:42.810 --> 18:43.540
You're here.

186
18:52.240 --> 18:53.040
What's wrong?

187
18:55.350 --> 18:57.480
Last time I was here, it was this price.

188
18:57.540 --> 18:59.530
Why did it go up so much all of a sudden?

189
18:59.530 --> 19:01.960
This is good stuff. Everyone likes it.

190
19:02.200 --> 19:03.800
When more people like it,

191
19:03.980 --> 19:05.680
it becomes more expensive.

192
19:06.000 --> 19:08.260
Then give me five silver dollars' worth.

193
19:09.140 --> 19:10.070
I'm not selling.

194
19:11.590 --> 19:12.350
Boss.

195
19:32.090 --> 19:32.890
Miss Lan Qing.

196
19:35.390 --> 19:36.320
Who are you?

197
19:36.900 --> 19:37.680
Let go of me.

198
19:41.510 --> 19:42.660
I am Tong Chunhai.

199
19:43.330 --> 19:45.330
Miss Lan Qing, you're a star

200
19:45.530 --> 19:47.130
with fans all over the world.

201
19:47.680 --> 19:48.900
I am just a drop in the ocean,

202
19:48.900 --> 19:50.630
so naturally you don't know me.

203
19:53.240 --> 19:55.090
But it's enough that you recognize this.

204
19:55.090 --> 19:56.530
This is my gift for our first meeting,

205
19:56.530 --> 19:57.440
Miss Lan Qing.

206
19:59.950 --> 20:01.590
I live in Laifu Alley,

207
20:01.640 --> 20:02.900
Jiazi Courtyard.

208
20:03.180 --> 20:03.960
If you're ever

209
20:03.960 --> 20:05.400
in the mood to...

210
20:09.010 --> 20:10.540
I'm always at your service.

211
20:34.230 --> 20:36.680
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

212
20:36.680 --> 20:37.270
These children

213
20:37.270 --> 20:38.730
are recovering very well.

214
20:38.850 --> 20:41.050
It's all thanks to your attentive care.

215
20:41.160 --> 20:41.360
Don't give me all the credit.

216
20:41.360 --> 20:43.220
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

217
20:43.220 --> 20:44.510
It's thanks to your extra

218
20:44.510 --> 20:45.640
patience with them

219
20:45.640 --> 20:47.440
that they are willing to listen to you

220
20:47.440 --> 20:49.370
and take their medicine properly.

221
20:49.920 --> 20:50.220
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

222
20:50.220 --> 20:51.900
Jinxuan, let me take you back.

223
20:52.180 --> 20:52.680
No need.

224
20:52.700 --> 20:53.770
I can go by myself.

225
20:54.200 --> 20:55.140
Then I'll call a rickshaw for you.

226
20:55.140 --> 20:55.770
Okay.

227
20:56.370 --> 20:57.080
Rickshaw!

228
20:57.450 --> 21:01.970
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

229
21:06.790 --> 21:07.520
I'm leaving.

230
21:07.600 --> 21:08.310
Bye.

231
21:09.050 --> 21:12.920
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

232
21:20.320 --> 21:21.830
Place one vertically here,

233
21:21.830 --> 21:22.810
here, in this direction.

234
21:22.810 --> 21:24.540
You, connect it horizontally.

235
21:26.130 --> 21:27.390
Align this corner.

236
22:03.480 --> 22:05.680
Let me help you up so you can give it a try.

237
22:13.070 --> 22:14.070
Don't be nervous.

238
22:15.240 --> 22:16.110
Dr. Dai is treating you

239
22:16.110 --> 22:17.200
with Western medicine

240
22:17.200 --> 22:18.730
and acupuncture every day.

241
22:19.010 --> 22:19.810
Besides,

242
22:20.610 --> 22:21.590
you used to be the bravest girl

243
22:21.590 --> 22:22.700
I've ever met.

244
22:24.730 --> 22:25.460
Let's try it.

245
22:28.160 --> 22:28.890
Let's try it.

246
23:03.280 --> 23:04.390
Don't stare at your toes.

247
23:04.390 --> 23:05.190
Look forward.

248
23:10.830 --> 23:11.570
Very good.

249
23:12.480 --> 23:13.340
The other foot.

250
23:13.960 --> 23:14.590
Very good.

251
23:15.290 --> 23:16.020
Take it easy.

252
23:19.110 --> 23:19.830
Don't worry.

253
23:19.830 --> 23:21.110
I won't let you fall.

254
23:25.840 --> 23:27.520
We'll take it step by step.

255
23:27.840 --> 23:28.380
Look.

256
23:29.310 --> 23:31.130
Your fingers were stiff before,

257
23:31.740 --> 23:32.220
but you can

258
23:32.220 --> 23:34.020
string beads freely now, right?

259
23:35.430 --> 23:36.890
We'll practice every day,

260
23:37.810 --> 23:39.740
and it will definitely get better.

261
23:40.080 --> 23:40.800
Okay?

262
23:43.640 --> 23:44.570
Let's continue.

263
23:53.300 --> 23:54.030
Very good.

264
23:57.200 --> 23:58.010
Slow down.

265
23:58.770 --> 24:00.500
You've already made progress.

266
24:14.570 --> 24:15.050
Here,

267
24:15.440 --> 24:16.640
drink your medicine.

268
24:27.090 --> 24:27.890
Zongzi candy.

269
24:36.570 --> 24:37.440
Dr. Dai said that

270
24:37.440 --> 24:39.790
soaking in hot springs can improve blood circulation,

271
24:39.790 --> 24:40.700
remove stasis, and relieve

272
24:40.700 --> 24:42.700
the pain caused by rehabilitation.

273
25:05.880 --> 25:06.610
Are you cold?

274
25:09.540 --> 25:10.430
No.

275
25:13.190 --> 25:14.350
Dr. Dai said

276
25:16.440 --> 25:18.270
that after every practice,

277
25:18.470 --> 25:20.330
we need to massage the acupoints.

278
25:22.330 --> 25:23.390
Tell me if it hurts.

279
25:32.150 --> 25:38.510
[Bend and Flow Freely]

280
26:22.920 --> 26:23.920
Does it hurt a lot?

281
26:26.160 --> 26:26.810
No.

282
26:28.070 --> 26:28.750
I'm fine.

283
26:35.560 --> 26:36.720
Tell me if it hurts.

284
26:37.440 --> 26:38.370
Don't hold it in.

285
27:01.980 --> 27:03.040
Covering your eyes

286
27:03.270 --> 27:04.900
helps train your balance.

287
27:07.810 --> 27:08.510
Relax a bit.

288
27:17.200 --> 27:18.160
Let go.

289
27:18.250 --> 27:19.380
I'll walk by myself.

290
27:20.070 --> 27:20.800
Are you sure?

291
28:02.700 --> 28:03.750
I can walk now.

292
28:08.220 --> 28:09.650
I can walk now!

293
28:10.380 --> 28:11.180
Yu Changxuan!

294
28:11.200 --> 28:12.810
I can walk now. I did it.

295
28:15.210 --> 28:16.270
Congratulations.

296
28:18.660 --> 28:19.660
Thank you.

297
28:20.460 --> 28:21.750
If it weren't for you,

298
28:22.200 --> 28:23.330
I wouldn't even know

299
28:23.330 --> 28:24.640
if I could wake up,

300
28:25.460 --> 28:26.400
nor would I know

301
28:26.570 --> 28:27.260
if I could

302
28:27.290 --> 28:28.330
walk and run

303
28:28.330 --> 28:29.530
like a normal person.

304
28:33.240 --> 28:34.570
What reward do you want?

305
28:36.240 --> 28:37.300
Anything you want.

306
28:40.980 --> 28:41.900
Zongzi candy.

307
28:55.270 --> 28:56.670
The evidence is all here.

308
28:57.050 --> 28:57.530
Speak.

309
28:58.330 --> 29:00.330
Who exactly colluded with you

310
29:00.350 --> 29:02.520
to pass off defective firearms as good ones and smuggle them

311
29:02.520 --> 29:03.520
into the army?

312
29:45.740 --> 29:46.350
Your family

313
29:46.350 --> 29:47.840
has been settled outside the city.

314
29:47.840 --> 29:49.700
They are not in any danger for now.

315
29:50.840 --> 29:52.490
But all of this depends

316
29:55.480 --> 29:57.200
on your cooperation.

317
30:01.480 --> 30:02.270
It's

318
30:03.440 --> 30:05.770
the brigade commander of the Fourth Army,

319
30:05.900 --> 30:06.300
Cai...

320
30:06.920 --> 30:08.550
Cai Fuhu.

321
30:18.360 --> 30:19.200
[Staff Department] [Inspector General's Office]

322
30:19.200 --> 30:20.000
Tong.

323
30:20.830 --> 30:22.480
Do you think we should tell

324
30:22.570 --> 30:24.630
Fifth Young Master Yu about Cai Fuhu?

325
30:25.010 --> 30:26.670
Let's not disturb him for now.

326
30:26.680 --> 30:28.550
Changxuan is helping Miss Ye recover.

327
30:28.550 --> 30:30.480
He needs to spend some time with her.

328
30:30.480 --> 30:31.160
Let's investigate

329
30:31.160 --> 30:32.310
Cai Fuhu's crimes first

330
30:32.310 --> 30:34.110
before reporting to Changxuan.

331
30:39.380 --> 30:42.010
You need to change how you address her from now on.

332
30:42.010 --> 30:43.200
Fifth Young Master Yu and Ye Pingjun

333
30:43.200 --> 30:44.250
have been married for almost two years.

334
30:44.250 --> 30:45.630
She's been our sister-in-law for a long time.

335
30:45.630 --> 30:49.290
From now on, you have to call her Pingjun, or Fifth Sister-in-law.

336
30:50.570 --> 30:51.110
Let's go.

337
30:57.630 --> 31:01.380
[Donning his robes and carrying his alms bowl, he entered Śrāvastī]

338
31:05.130 --> 31:07.700
[Diamond Sutra]

339
31:20.680 --> 31:21.510
Young Madam.

340
31:23.410 --> 31:24.570
Didn't you ask me

341
31:24.610 --> 31:26.500
to find some magazines and novels for you?

342
31:26.500 --> 31:27.160
Take a look

343
31:27.160 --> 31:28.570
and see if you like any of these.

344
31:28.570 --> 31:29.770
I'll go buy some more.

345
31:29.780 --> 31:32.830
[Manufactured by China Yapuer Electrical Appliance Factory]

346
31:32.830 --> 31:34.070
[Xuede]

347
31:36.070 --> 31:37.180
Just leave them here.

348
31:37.180 --> 31:38.440
I'll look through them later.

349
31:38.440 --> 31:39.160
Thank you.

350
31:39.610 --> 31:42.410
Then I'll go to the kitchen to prepare some snacks.

351
32:39.400 --> 32:40.600
What are you reading?

352
32:42.090 --> 32:43.590
This author's writing

353
32:43.590 --> 32:44.900
is simple and sincere.

354
32:45.050 --> 32:46.850
Although the words are not flowery,

355
32:46.850 --> 32:48.710
they are full of charm and beauty.

356
32:48.850 --> 32:50.590
He writes about the fragility of life,

357
32:50.590 --> 32:51.550
but reading it

358
32:51.550 --> 32:54.280
leaves one deeply stirred and profoundly moved.

359
32:55.550 --> 32:57.850
If you like it, it must be good.

360
33:04.560 --> 33:06.370
[Lotus tribulation By Jun Guan]

361
33:14.680 --> 33:18.780
[Lotus tribulation By Jun Guan]

362
33:27.300 --> 33:28.700
Who brought you the book?

363
33:30.630 --> 33:31.790
Xiaotang.

364
33:32.600 --> 33:33.420
What's wrong?

365
33:35.360 --> 33:36.620
I have something to do.

366
33:37.440 --> 33:39.900
I'll come back later to have dinner with you.

367
33:52.830 --> 33:54.510
Did you hire this maid?

368
33:54.540 --> 33:56.070
Yes, Fifth Young Master Yu.

369
33:56.660 --> 33:57.400
She...

370
33:57.510 --> 33:59.090
Did she do something wrong?

371
33:59.430 --> 34:00.940
We don't need her here anymore.

372
34:00.940 --> 34:02.670
Tell her to leave immediately.

373
34:04.250 --> 34:05.030
Fifth Young Master Yu.

374
34:05.030 --> 34:05.770
I beg of you.

375
34:05.800 --> 34:06.960
Please don't kick me out.

376
34:06.960 --> 34:08.690
Please don't kick me out.

377
34:09.360 --> 34:10.940
My dad is a gambler.

378
34:11.110 --> 34:12.420
Nanny Zhao was kind enough

379
34:12.420 --> 34:13.800
to buy me and bring me to Fengtai

380
34:13.800 --> 34:14.690
to work.

381
34:14.840 --> 34:16.280
The Fifth Young Madam is so nice.

382
34:16.280 --> 34:17.670
I really took care of her

383
34:17.670 --> 34:18.900
with all my heart.

384
34:19.090 --> 34:19.960
Fifth Young Master Yu.

385
34:19.960 --> 34:20.840
I beg of you.

386
34:20.840 --> 34:21.940
Don't kick me out.

387
34:21.940 --> 34:23.460
Please, please.

388
34:23.460 --> 34:25.510
Fifth Young Master Yu, I beg of you.

389
34:25.510 --> 34:26.960
Don't kick me out.

390
34:35.050 --> 34:36.150
Please.

391
34:36.570 --> 34:38.000
Xiaotang, get up.

392
34:51.960 --> 34:53.290
Without my permission,

393
34:53.870 --> 34:55.670
no one is allowed to kick her out.

394
35:09.250 --> 35:10.360
Come out quickly.

395
35:20.610 --> 35:21.650
I asked Xiaotang

396
35:22.130 --> 35:24.060
to find those publications for me.

397
35:24.520 --> 35:26.160
I just wanted to pass the time.

398
35:26.160 --> 35:27.820
It has nothing to do with her.

399
35:29.680 --> 35:31.280
I don't know how these things

400
35:31.520 --> 35:32.760
violated your rules,

401
35:32.760 --> 35:33.820
Mr. Yu.

402
35:34.880 --> 35:36.770
These are reactionary publications.

403
35:36.770 --> 35:38.410
They do you no good.

404
35:38.440 --> 35:39.010
So you're just casually

405
35:39.010 --> 35:40.110
selling off a girl?

406
35:40.130 --> 35:41.530
She did something wrong,

407
35:42.030 --> 35:43.630
so she can't stay in Fengtai.

408
35:51.030 --> 35:51.980
Why did you suddenly

409
35:51.980 --> 35:53.090
become like this?

410
36:01.550 --> 36:03.030
You are good to me,

411
36:04.440 --> 36:05.760
but I'm not an object

412
36:05.760 --> 36:07.160
for you to imprison here.

413
36:08.120 --> 36:09.420
If you can't treat me

414
36:09.420 --> 36:10.500
as an equal,

415
36:12.880 --> 36:13.980
I'll have to reconsider

416
36:13.980 --> 36:15.510
our relationship.

417
36:38.190 --> 36:39.400
I can reconsider

418
36:40.760 --> 36:42.340
sending Xiaotang away.

419
36:44.500 --> 36:46.260
As for our relationship...

420
36:48.360 --> 36:49.650
When it begins

421
36:51.120 --> 36:52.680
and when it ends

422
36:55.170 --> 36:56.890
are all up to me.

423
37:21.920 --> 37:26.880
[Xiangxi Hotel]

424
37:32.820 --> 37:33.480
Okay, okay.

425
37:33.510 --> 37:34.680
That's enough.

426
37:34.700 --> 37:36.480
Don't drink so much.

427
37:37.710 --> 37:38.440
Let me tell you.

428
37:38.440 --> 37:40.000
When you talk to Fifth Sister-in-law,

429
37:40.000 --> 37:41.000
you can't act like you're in a military camp,

430
37:41.000 --> 37:41.980
giving orders

431
37:41.980 --> 37:43.340
so aggressively.

432
37:43.460 --> 37:44.510
When you return to Fengtai,

433
37:44.510 --> 37:45.670
speak to her gently, coax her a little,

434
37:45.670 --> 37:47.070
and it'll be all fine.

435
37:48.770 --> 37:50.170
From the very beginning,

436
37:52.610 --> 37:53.820
it felt as if there was

437
37:55.020 --> 37:55.570
an invisible

438
37:55.570 --> 37:57.030
wall between her and me.

439
38:01.920 --> 38:02.930
I didn't expect

440
38:04.700 --> 38:06.390
that when I got closer,

441
38:09.030 --> 38:10.910
the wall would still be there.

442
38:11.400 --> 38:12.400
If you ask me,

443
38:12.960 --> 38:14.100
comforting words

444
38:14.130 --> 38:15.820
are better said between women.

445
38:15.820 --> 38:16.810
That's what works.

446
38:16.810 --> 38:17.390
Right?

447
38:20.480 --> 38:22.140
Maybe we can ask Miss Lan Qing.

448
38:24.380 --> 38:25.630
Her relationship with Pingjun

449
38:25.630 --> 38:26.760
used to be very good.

450
38:27.310 --> 38:29.510
They might still share that connection.

451
38:29.510 --> 38:30.380
You know what,

452
38:30.380 --> 38:31.780
Gu's idea is not bad.

453
38:31.780 --> 38:32.980
He's finally using his head.

454
38:32.980 --> 38:33.650
Really.

455
38:33.940 --> 38:35.050
Having Miss Lan Qing persuade her

456
38:35.050 --> 38:35.630
will definitely be more effective

457
38:35.630 --> 38:36.840
than having a bunch of men like us do it.

458
38:36.840 --> 38:37.320
Right?

459
38:46.230 --> 38:47.170
Why did you suddenly

460
38:47.170 --> 38:48.300
become like this?

461
38:56.780 --> 38:58.130
You are good to me.

462
38:59.670 --> 39:00.880
But I'm not an object

463
39:00.880 --> 39:02.280
for you to imprison here.

464
39:02.980 --> 39:04.320
If you can't treat me

465
39:04.340 --> 39:05.230
as an equal,

466
39:07.110 --> 39:08.070
I'll have to reconsider

467
39:08.070 --> 39:09.670
our relationship.

468
39:12.840 --> 39:14.630
As for our relationship...

469
39:15.940 --> 39:17.280
When it begins

470
39:18.550 --> 39:20.360
and when it ends

471
39:21.230 --> 39:22.730
are all up to me.

472
39:41.600 --> 39:45.030
[Yuchun Theater]

473
40:08.120 --> 40:10.420
Why are you here at this time?

474
40:11.050 --> 40:12.780
You haven't been here for days.

475
40:13.260 --> 40:14.230
Lan Qing.

476
40:14.610 --> 40:15.770
There is something

477
40:16.190 --> 40:17.390
I need your help with.

478
41:15.440 --> 41:16.430
Lan Qing.

479
41:16.770 --> 41:18.570
You sing so beautifully.

480
41:19.130 --> 41:21.930
Thank you for coming all the way to keep me company.

481
41:23.360 --> 41:24.150
Pingjun.

482
41:25.650 --> 41:27.510
Do you really remember nothing?

483
41:32.080 --> 41:34.140
I can't remember anything

484
41:34.730 --> 41:36.550
about my days at Yuchun Theater.

485
41:37.460 --> 41:39.460
But when I heard your voice just now,

486
41:39.970 --> 41:41.380
I suddenly felt

487
41:41.530 --> 41:43.730
an inexplicable sense of familiarity.

488
41:53.230 --> 41:53.940
[The Jewelry Purse]

489
41:53.940 --> 41:54.650
Look.

490
41:55.860 --> 41:56.110
[Script Content of The Jewelry Purse]

491
41:56.110 --> 41:58.070
You were my former script copyist.

492
41:58.530 --> 41:59.990
You helped me copy scripts

493
42:00.760 --> 42:01.570
and read them to me

494
42:01.570 --> 42:02.860
over and over again.

495
42:04.590 --> 42:05.400
Later,

496
42:05.900 --> 42:06.500
you went to Chunfeng Troupe

497
42:06.500 --> 42:07.510
[Script Content of The Jewelry Purse]

498
42:07.510 --> 42:08.970
to write civilized drama.

499
42:09.260 --> 42:10.860
Those progressive students

500
42:10.900 --> 42:12.820
and educated gentlemen and ladies

501
42:12.820 --> 42:14.550
were all full of praise for you.

502
42:15.550 --> 42:16.530
Everything you wrote

503
42:16.530 --> 42:17.710
was about the great cause

504
42:17.710 --> 42:19.650
of saving the country and the people.

505
42:19.650 --> 42:22.310
You even wrote plays to boycott Japanese goods.

506
42:23.760 --> 42:24.550
Pingjun,

507
42:25.190 --> 42:26.530
I really admire you.

508
42:27.960 --> 42:29.460
The things you've done

509
42:29.650 --> 42:31.500
are beyond my capabilities.

510
42:35.500 --> 42:36.440
Lan Qing.

511
42:37.820 --> 42:38.710
Thank you for telling me

512
42:38.710 --> 42:39.860
about the past.

513
42:42.860 --> 42:43.840
Miss Lan Qing.

514
42:44.170 --> 42:44.900
Today, it's thanks to

515
42:44.900 --> 42:45.650
the Young Madam that

516
42:45.650 --> 42:47.110
I'm able to listen to your performance.

517
42:47.110 --> 42:47.710
Young Madam,

518
42:47.710 --> 42:49.310
it's time for your medicine.

519
42:50.040 --> 42:51.540
I don't need to drink it

520
42:51.570 --> 42:53.420
three times a day without fail, do I?

521
42:53.420 --> 42:54.550
Put it aside for now.

522
42:55.440 --> 42:56.320
Young Madam.

523
42:56.860 --> 42:58.680
Fifth Young Master Yu knows you find this medicine bitter,

524
42:58.680 --> 43:00.610
so he personally went to several old shops

525
43:00.610 --> 43:02.140
to buy you pear syrup candy,

526
43:02.190 --> 43:04.850
saying it's the best for relieving bitterness.

527
43:37.860 --> 43:38.550
Pingjun,

528
43:39.110 --> 43:41.510
Fifth Young Master Yu is very considerate toward you.

529
43:41.510 --> 43:43.590
He still cares about you a lot.

530
43:46.550 --> 43:48.200
I know he is good.

531
43:50.280 --> 43:52.070
But I always feel that

532
43:52.500 --> 43:53.640
there is something

533
43:53.660 --> 43:54.780
separating us.

534
43:59.920 --> 44:00.900
Relax.

535
44:01.900 --> 44:02.950
I witnessed how

536
44:02.980 --> 44:04.510
the two of you got together.

537
44:05.050 --> 44:06.980
The first time I saw him look at you,

538
44:07.320 --> 44:08.320
I knew

539
44:09.000 --> 44:10.820
he held you dear to his heart.

540
44:11.300 --> 44:12.670
Your joys and sorrows

541
44:13.010 --> 44:14.820
are his top priority.

542
44:16.420 --> 44:17.500
Whether it's him

543
44:18.340 --> 44:19.130
or you,

544
44:20.610 --> 44:23.140
you would both risk your lives for each other.

545
44:27.510 --> 44:28.710
However,

546
44:28.920 --> 44:30.980
when it comes to matters of the heart,

547
44:31.460 --> 44:33.110
outsiders can't say much.

548
44:36.420 --> 44:38.420
As for you and Fifth Young Master Yu,

549
44:38.690 --> 44:42.550
you will come to understand it in time.

550
44:54.930 --> 44:56.300
Come again.

551
44:56.300 --> 44:56.780
[Jiayu Zhai Restaurant]

552
44:56.780 --> 44:57.550
Come again.

553
44:57.550 --> 44:57.960
Okay.

554
44:59.150 --> 45:00.510
Slow down. Come again.

555
45:00.550 --> 45:02.090
I'll come again tomorrow.

556
45:02.150 --> 45:03.010
Come again.

557
45:03.300 --> 45:05.560
[Jiayu Zhai Restaurant]

558
45:05.560 --> 45:06.500
Whose car is this?

559
45:06.500 --> 45:07.760
It's blocking the way.

560
45:07.800 --> 45:09.360
Move it!

561
45:11.590 --> 45:12.400
Cai Fuhu.

562
45:18.520 --> 45:19.770
What are you doing?

563
45:24.080 --> 45:26.590
[Fengtai]

564
45:36.880 --> 45:37.670
Young Madam.

565
45:37.980 --> 45:39.320
The doctor said your legs are recovering

566
45:39.320 --> 45:40.130
very well.

567
45:42.340 --> 45:43.340
The doctor also advised

568
45:43.340 --> 45:44.820
you to walk around more.

569
45:45.070 --> 45:46.670
Fifth Young Master Yu's temporary command post

570
45:46.670 --> 45:47.800
is not far from Fengtai.

571
45:47.800 --> 45:49.820
There are even ginkgo trees along the road outside,

572
45:49.820 --> 45:51.570
and the leaves are golden.

573
45:52.480 --> 45:53.800
Shall I accompany you out

574
45:53.800 --> 45:54.600
to take a look?

575
45:56.480 --> 45:57.010
Alright.

576
45:58.340 --> 45:58.830
Here.

577
46:05.610 --> 46:06.510
I was foolish.

578
46:06.670 --> 46:07.820
I deserve to die.

579
46:08.030 --> 46:09.150
I was foolish.

580
46:09.330 --> 46:10.470
I deserve to die.

581
46:10.500 --> 46:11.320
I deserve to die.

582
46:11.320 --> 46:13.050
Are you done hitting yourself?

583
46:14.030 --> 46:15.150
It's time to talk business.

584
46:15.150 --> 46:16.280
Fifth Young Master Yu.

585
46:16.280 --> 46:17.380
It was a moment of foolishness.

586
46:17.380 --> 46:19.190
I just wanted to make a little money.

587
46:19.190 --> 46:20.550
I didn't swap in that many

588
46:20.550 --> 46:21.520
defective guns.

589
46:21.650 --> 46:23.050
I have elderly parents and young children to support.

590
46:23.050 --> 46:24.180
If I die,

591
46:24.440 --> 46:25.460
how will they survive

592
46:25.460 --> 46:26.510
in the future?

593
46:26.510 --> 46:27.630
I beg of you.

594
46:29.180 --> 46:30.890
You make it sound so simple.

595
46:31.480 --> 46:33.500
Do you know that your batch of defective guns

596
46:33.500 --> 46:34.840
almost caused an entire squad

597
46:34.840 --> 46:36.710
to be completely wiped out?

598
46:46.580 --> 46:47.740
Fifth Young Master Yu.

599
46:47.740 --> 46:49.030
It's all my fault.

600
46:49.130 --> 46:49.880
My son

601
46:49.880 --> 46:51.340
just turned eighteen.

602
46:51.360 --> 46:52.440
Please be merciful

603
46:52.440 --> 46:53.730
and spare him.

604
46:54.300 --> 46:56.130
Your son is a son,

605
46:57.300 --> 46:59.500
but other people's sons are worthless?

606
47:00.300 --> 47:02.460
Your son has only been in the army for a year,

607
47:02.460 --> 47:03.980
and you've already led him to do so many

608
47:03.980 --> 47:05.860
heartless deals,

609
47:06.350 --> 47:09.080
causing so many innocent soldiers to die in vain.

610
47:09.350 --> 47:10.310
Tell me,

611
47:12.190 --> 47:13.760
why should I spare him?

612
47:20.400 --> 47:21.190
Dad, Dad.

613
47:21.260 --> 47:22.140
I don't want to die.

614
47:22.140 --> 47:23.010
Save me, Dad.

615
47:23.010 --> 47:24.070
I don't want to die.

616
47:24.860 --> 47:25.800
Fifth Young Master Yu!

617
47:25.800 --> 47:26.780
Fifth Young Master Yu!

618
47:26.780 --> 47:28.530
Officer Gu, Officer Gu!

619
47:29.000 --> 47:30.800
Please help me persuade Fifth Young Master Yu.

620
47:30.800 --> 47:33.200
It was really just a moment of foolishness.

621
47:33.590 --> 47:34.340
Fifth Young Master Yu.

622
47:34.340 --> 47:35.030
Fifth Young Master Yu.

623
47:35.030 --> 47:36.510
Please consider that this is my first offense.

624
47:36.510 --> 47:37.380
I beg of you.

625
47:37.380 --> 47:38.920
Spare our worthless lives.

626
47:39.300 --> 47:41.000
Spare your worthless lives?

627
47:42.260 --> 47:43.690
So many soldiers lost their lives.

628
47:43.690 --> 47:45.050
Who will pay for them?

629
47:47.730 --> 47:48.280
Fifth Young Master Yu...

630
47:48.280 --> 47:50.020
T-This has nothing to do with me, Fifth Young Master Yu!

631
47:50.020 --> 47:51.150
My dad forced me to do it!

632
47:51.150 --> 47:52.410
Fifth Young Master Yu!

633
48:19.170 --> 48:21.350
Drag these two bastards away.
